Error [E0102]: Nothing named `unknown_name` exists here
  --> dsl_block_body_keeps_normal_sema_and_registry_rules.jet:1:30
    |
  1 | fn run() { #SQL { missing :: unknown_name() } }
    |                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Only functions that have been defined (or built in, like `print` / `input`) can be called
 Fix: Define it first (fn unknown_name() { ... }), or call one that exists
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102
